============================================================================
The seven runs above happened and their verdicts are true. This line's ORIGINAL
label was not: row M4 said it covered "sites 4/7", and it did not. An
adversarial verifier deleted change site 7 alone -- the single
`config=load_config(Path(args.config)) ...` line in
