and `pytest tests/test_managed_path_config_read.py -q` reported 8 passed.
`grep -rln "_qualify_one_profile" tests/` returned nothing at all. All of M4's
redness came from site 4, the `config=` parameter on
`preparation.qualification_subject_manifest`.

Per row, stated as what is proven and what is not:

  M1  site 6 only -- `config_path=args.config` in `_cmd_reason`. R1 observes
      only that SOMETHING about the path reaches the (monkeypatched) service.
  M2  sites 2-3 only -- `base=`/`config=` on `_config_for_profile` and
