  M5  site 5 only -- `config_digest` omitted from `_request_digest`.
  M6  site 5 only -- `config_digest` admitted unconditionally.
  M7  site 2 only -- the profile's ownership of `roles`.

Not covered by any row above, and the reason this correction exists:
